[en.DECISION_C07_LPLAB_215]
Code 215. <=New Cider=>

[en.DECISION_C07_LPLAB_215_desc]
Code 215. <=New Cider=> : Aims to develop an improved SSCS-6000 machine that can produce cider without the need for quality inspection, while still maintaining a decent taste. Prototype: Super Speedy Cider Squeezy 6000.

[en.DECISION_C07_LPLAB_215_TOOLTIP]
§YThere is a certain possibility of failure. §!

[zh.DECISION_C07_LPLAB_215]
代号215.「新苹果汁」

[zh.DECISION_C07_LPLAB_215_desc]
代号215.「新苹果汁」：旨在改进SSCS-6000机器，在省略产品质检的前提下，保证口感不会太差。原型：超级快速苹果榨汁机6000。

[zh.DECISION_C07_LPLAB_215_TOOLTIP]
§Y有一定可能性会失败。§!
